    {
      "id": "7d6dc65",
      "container": "71672bd",
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Willow Valley RV Resort is Northeast Ga’s luxurious campground. Located in the beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains. We are just 2 hours north of Atlanta, Ga. and 2 hours south of Asheville, NC."
    },
    {
      "id": "e41dceb",
      "container": "71672bd",
      "type": "toggle",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "News #1",
          "html": "<p>“Looking to host a Rally, Family Reunions or a Get Away with friends and family, then Willow Valley RV Campground is the perfect place for you. Call us to inquire about our group rates.”</p>"
        },
        {
          "title": "News #2",
          "html": "<p>“All campers, travel trailers or class a, that are over 10 years old must be approved by management. please call our office for details.”</p>"
        },
        {
          "title": "News #3",
          "html": "<p>PHASE 2 SITES ARE NOW OPEN, 22 paved sites with river view sites available.</p>"
        },
        {
          "title": "News #4",
          "html": "<p>Due to the FREEZING temps that we have here in the mountains, you need to have a Heated Water Hose.</p>"
        },
        {
          "title": "News #5",
          "html": "<p>Our new Summer Office Hours are from 9:00 am to 5:00 pm.</p><p>Winter Hrs: MON – SAT 9:00AM TO 3:00 PM</p><p>SUNDAYS 10:00 AM TO 3:00 PM.</p>"
        }
      ]
